  triage:title "AG-VAL-019/020 checklist rows marked PASS but evidence is loopback-only, not the required self-IP proof" ;
  triage:description "docs/plans/phase-AG/cross-host-smoke-checklist.md lines 47-48 now show AG-VAL-019/AG-VAL-020 as PASS (changed from PENDING in QA-1), citing evidence artifact files docs/plans/phase-AG/artifacts/ag13/ag-val-019-selfip-unauthorized.txt and ag-val-020-selfip-success.txt (both timestamped Fri Jul 17 13:35:58 2026, matching commit 6d2afb4c's push time). AG13-QA-2 independently verified via grep that BOTH artifact files contain NO non-loopback IP literals (no 192./10./172./advertise/bind patterns) -- they are real cargo-test/CLI transcripts (genuine evidence, not fabricated), but the transcripts document loopback-only behavior, not the self-IP-against-real-interface proof the checklist row claims. This is a mischaracterization of genuine evidence, not absence of evidence -- classified partially-present by all three reviewers (req-qa, arch-qa, RBP)." ;
