  triage:notes "Closed in AG.13 Group 4. AG-VAL-019 and AG-VAL-020 now point at regenerated evidence files that include the literal non-loopback self-IP fixture `192.0.0.2`, and the checklist rows now reference the real self-IP proofs in crates/atm-daemon/src/tests/runtime_root/self_ip.rs instead of the old loopback-relabeled path. Validation: cargo fmt --all, just lint, cargo test -p atm-daemon -p agent-team-mail-core all passed." .

